**What I did**

- Wrote the heartbeat first, with pid and epoch.
- Emailed Ed with the verdict, exit code, refusal reason and detail, branch name and the three watchdog fields. Gmail confirms the message carries the SENT label.
- Wrote courier.sent after acceptance.
